L000150	{\it Model.}
L000151	We consider a generic model for vector phenomena based on coherently coupled NLSEs. It describes spinor Bose–Einstein condensates with
L000152	field-induced
L000153	spin-flip coupling \cite{stringari16}, allowing studies of
L000154	
L000155	
L000156	quantum phase transitions \cite{cominotti23}, or bubble nucleation in
L000157	ferromagnetic superfluids \cite{zenesini23}.
L000158	
L000159	
L000160	The coherently coupled NLSEs also describe the polarization dynamics of an optical wave propagating in  a weakly birefringent fiber \cite{millot_prl97,agrawal}:
L000161	
L000162	
L000163	
L000164	
L000165	
