L000361	Simulations of NLSE [Eq. (\ref{eq:nls})] confirm the theoretical prediction [Eq. (\ref{eq:lambda_0})], \blue{as illustrated in Fig. \ref{fig:fig2}(a). The figure shows 100 independent realizations of the initial uncorrelated random waves $u_{x,y}(t,z=0)$ (black lines); whose ensemble average (green line) agrees with the instability growth-rate (\ref{eq:lambda_0}) (red line).}
