L000462	\blue{{\it Experiments on the reversible turbulent regime.}
L000463	
L000464	For small initial anomalous correlations  $|M(z=0)| \simeq 0$, we have seen through the criterion (\ref{eq:threshold}) that $|M|$ can be unstable. Experimental constraints, however, prevent simultaneously launching a strong  unbalanced population $S_1 \simeq S_0$ with a small phase-correlation $|M|\simeq 0$, precluding a direct experimental test of criterion (\ref{eq:threshold}).
